{"id":120886,"date":"2024-04-25T14:48:03","date_gmt":"2024-04-25T14:48:03","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/?p=120886"},"modified":"2024-04-25T14:48:03","modified_gmt":"2024-04-25T14:48:03","slug":"dewan-serahkan-rekomendasi-lkpj-bupati-jember-2023","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/dewan-serahkan-rekomendasi-lkpj-bupati-jember-2023\/","title":{"rendered":"Dewan Serahkan Rekomendasi LKPJ Bupati Jember 2023"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-120899\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/20240425115334_IMG_2400.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"6240\" height=\"4160\" \/><\/p>\n<p>JEMBER, Ketua DPRD Kabupaten Jember, M. Itqon Syauqi menyerahkan rekomendasi Laporan Keterangan Pertanggungjawaban (LKPJ) Bupati Jember 2023, Kamis 25 April 2024.<\/p>\n<p>Rekomendasi LKPJ 2023 itu diterima langsung oleh Bupati Jember Hendy Siswanto di depan sidang paripurna.<\/p>\n<div id='gallery-1' class='gallery galleryid-120886 gallery-columns-4 gallery-size-full'><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/20240425111705_IMG_2347.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"6240\" height=\"4160\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/20240425111705_IMG_2347.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/20240425111727_IMG_2349.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"6240\" height=\"4160\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/20240425111727_IMG_2349.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/20240425111830_IMG_2354.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"6240\" height=\"4160\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/20240425111830_IMG_2354.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/20240425111844_IMG_2357.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"6240\" height=\"4160\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/20240425111844_IMG_2357.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/20240425111924_IMG_2358.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"6240\" height=\"4160\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/20240425111924_IMG_2358.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/20240425112015_IMG_2362.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"6240\" height=\"4160\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/20240425112015_IMG_2362.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/20240425112053_IMG_2363.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"6240\" height=\"4160\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/20240425112053_IMG_2363.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/20240425112118_IMG_2365.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"6240\" height=\"4160\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/20240425112118_IMG_2365.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<p>Itqon menyampaikan, terdapat beberapa poin rekomendasi yang harus segera digeber pemerintahan Bupati Jember Hendy Siswanto bersama Wakil Bupati Jember Muhammad Balya Firjaun Barlaman yang tinggal sedikit lagi selesai masa jabatannya.<\/p>\n<p>&#8220;Bagi kami yang paling penting adalah pengentasan kemiskinan dan pengangguran terbuka, itu sudah kami catatkan dalam LKPJ 2023, mumpung masih ada waktu, ayo cepetan digeber inovasi-inovasi untuk kedua poin itu,&#8221; ujar Itqon.<\/p>\n<p>Menanggapi hal tersebut, Bupati Jember Hendy Siswanto menyampaikan terima kasih atas koreksi dari dewan.<\/p>\n<p>Ia berujar, pemerintahan yang dipimpinnya mampu menurunkan tingkat kemiskinan yang mana pada 2023 telah berada di peringkat 18 se-Jawa Timur.<\/p>\n<div id='gallery-2' class='gallery galleryid-120886 gallery-columns-4 gallery-size-full'><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/20240425112322_IMG_2370.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"6240\" height=\"4160\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/20240425112322_IMG_2370.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/20240425112438_IMG_2374.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"6240\" height=\"4160\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/20240425112438_IMG_2374.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/20240425112449_IMG_2377.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"6240\" height=\"4160\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/20240425112449_IMG_2377.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/20240425114347_IMG_2387.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"6240\" height=\"4160\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/20240425114347_IMG_2387.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/20240425115334_IMG_2400.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"6240\" height=\"4160\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/20240425115334_IMG_2400.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/20240425115400_IMG_2411.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"6240\" height=\"4160\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/20240425115400_IMG_2411.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/20240425115723_IMG_2420.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"6240\" height=\"4160\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/20240425115723_IMG_2420.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/20240425115953_IMG_2429.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"6240\" height=\"4160\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/20240425115953_IMG_2429.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<p>&#8220;Pada 2022 itu kemiskinan Jember berada di peringkat 2, kemudian 2023 membaik yakni kemiskinan Jember berada di peringkat 18 se-Jatim,&#8221; ujar Bupati Hendy Siswanto.<\/p>\n<p>Kendati demikian, Hendy mengaku belum puas dengan pencapaian itu. Ia berkomitmen akan terus memperbaiki perekonomian dan mengurangi pengangguran terbuka di Kabupaten Jember. (ipf<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>JEMBER, Ketua DPRD Kabupaten Jember, M. Itqon Syauqi menyerahkan rekomendasi Laporan Keterangan Pertanggungjawaban (LKPJ) Bupati Jember 2023, Kamis 25 April 2024. Rekomendasi LKPJ 2023 itu diterima langsung oleh Bupati Jember Hendy Siswanto di depan sidang paripurna. Itqon menyampaikan, terdapat beberapa poin rekomendasi yang harus segera digeber pemerintahan Bupati Jember Hendy Siswanto bersama Wakil Bupati Jember &hellip;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":120899,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[3],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-120886","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnai